From 273b3df437ba8a4934b0f9aa3fb9b1772ccef260 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 18:05:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] BoomerAMG and hybrid solver: StrongThreshold option, as in
 the official repository

The official repository added the StrongThreshold option of BoomerAMG
(#495), which the prototype named StrengthThreshold. The option of the
official repository is kept: StrengthThreshold is renamed StrongThreshold
for BoomerAMG and for the hybrid solver of hypre, in the sources, the
tests and the documentation. The description of the glossary is the one
of the official repository.
